24.d0                           ,| Output interval in hours (dtsave_traj)
../../inputs/trajectoire/T2.nc  ,| Input NetCDF file (filetrajin)
./PlT2.nc                       ,| Output trajectory file (filetrajout)
1                               ,| Particles released per NetCDF position (nb_part_intro)
1                               ,| Vertical advection and turbulent diffusion (itypevert)
